        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-02T21:39:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I know it\u0027s strange, but we need the precharge phase to finely control the current in the beginning stages. This is just a limitation of the architecture.",
      "parentUuid": "37223016_0f355395",
      "revId": "634f55da7278b365366670729829ece3e2409060",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2840ae98_7db6d378",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
