      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-08T17:30:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had thought about that to, but it should only be an issue if the current requested is less than the precharge current.\n\nWhat\u0027s the sequence of charge requests that you are seeing with your battery?",
