      "writtenOn": "2021-12-09T05:48:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ISL reply as if C0 is in OTG mode , BGATE will fully turn On , BGATE will not work in linear mode in OTG mode , 0x14 recommend set 0A to prevent limit OTG current if want to have desire trickle charged . \nAt this time if want to have trickle charge ,  it does not set C0 0x14 256mA and to have trickle charger as BGATE is fully turn on in OTG mode , set C0 256mA also limit OTG current   ,\nplease set C1 0x15 Vsys level from 6V , lower than Vbatt for example 7V , and increase C1 0x15 little bit higher than battery voltage to control the desire trickle change current .",
      "parentUuid": "cb5348d1_16e75502",
      "revId": "634f55da7278b365366670729829ece3e2409060",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
