      "writtenOn": "2021-12-10T00:49:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But that would be disabling linear charging... Note that that was the previous implementation. We needed linear charge because the main loop cannot control the current that tightly at such low currents; there\u0027s always some ripple with the BFET fully on.\n\nWhat\u0027s the sequence of charge requests that you are seeing with your battery?",
